{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XJt2UIG77i1793720139.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>佐敦有食水管爆裂，晚上約9時起恢復供水。</p><p></p><p>停水期間，水務署出動兩架水車和5個水箱，又安排樽裝水供受影響市民。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WATER-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wxQrX3t71Y1793720158.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>事發在下午4時許，水務署在德成街維修鹹水管期間，一條毗連施工位置，負責供應食水予高景臺及康源閣的食水管突然爆裂，大量食水湧出馬路，經搶修後，晚上約9時起恢復供水。</p><p></p><p>水務署正調查事故原因。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:21:15.230795+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T20:58:29.923236+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:27.180606+00:00","content_hash":"b5831ced1e3e6378fa88e7b200ce89b403e3c706b3de685861e5a3a578dc47f4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}